    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/26797c4cce1eda0d58ada0295c3da5c4.avif?t=1755286065\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/94b19d72971d604ddffa4b00305b5a9a.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring is a real-time strategy game where humans and orcs fight for dominance. Build bases, manage resources, and lead armies. Wield magic, unleash cannons, and outsmart foes in dynamic battles. Defend from waves of undead at night! Sounds familiar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/2b32a06618fca8fe23850d59b5230d3e.poster.avif?t=1755286065\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/2b32a06618fca8fe23850d59b5230d3e.webm?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/2b32a06618fca8fe23850d59b5230d3e.mp4?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/54e5ea5ef579844f5d3f8dab521015dd.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a unique mode of The Scouring, become a powerful hero, crushing foes with devastating skills. Gain experience, collect items, and customize your playstyle, blending action RPG combat with strategic army control. Shape battles with spells, weapons, and tactics to claim victory. Enter dungeons to look for precious items. BE THE HERO. Control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/dfccad7e03afacc99e687d6802ca94e9.poster.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/dfccad7e03afacc99e687d6802ca94e9.webm?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/dfccad7e03afacc99e687d6802ca94e9.mp4?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring delivers epic multiplayer battles with team skirmishes, and free-for-alls for up to 8 players. \u0421ustomize matches, and test your skill in dynamic modes. Forge alliances or dominate foes in the ultimate multiplayer RTS experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USER GENERATED CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring unlocks endless creativity with Steam Workshop integration. Download custom maps, modes, and AI scripts or create and share your own. With powerful tools and a vibrant community, every game offers fresh challenges and infinite variety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTION RPG STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring introduces a new genre: Action RPG Strategy. Customize your hero, equip gear, and unleash powerful abilities in fast-paced combat. While you dominate the battlefield, AI manages your army, resources, and bases, blending action and strategy seamlessly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/e199124842919bd45b3740cec1636582.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1d6b96b2f300938c6069633041788e78.poster.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1d6b96b2f300938c6069633041788e78.webm?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1d6b96b2f300938c6069633041788e78.mp4?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring started as a solo developer\u2019s dream to create the ultimate RTS. Inspired by classics and built with passion, it thrives on community feedback. Join our Discord, follow and read X, get in touch on Reddit! Together, we\u2019ll refine, expand, and create something special. Thank you for being part of this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1f925dce3b1b757d408fe6960bc5814f.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention to Detail</strong>: Immerse yourself in richly detailed, visually striking environments. Watch battles unfold with dynamic destruction, lifelike unit movement, and spell effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Gameplay</strong>: Fluid and polished controls that allow you to fully utilize your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action RPG Strategy</strong>: New gameplay experience and new genre. You control a powerful hero while AI manages your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>: Engage in ranked matches, free-for-alls, or team battles with custom games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User-Generated Content</strong>: Explore and share maps and modes via Steam Workshop. Create AI scripts to automate strategies and watch them play in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-Driven Development</strong>: Shaped by players and their feedback.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/94b19d72971d604ddffa4b00305b5a9a.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring is a real-time strategy game where humans and orcs fight for dominance. Build bases, manage resources, and lead armies. Wield magic, unleash cannons, and outsmart foes in dynamic battles. Defend from waves of undead at night! Sounds familiar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/2b32a06618fca8fe23850d59b5230d3e.poster.avif?t=1755286065\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/2b32a06618fca8fe23850d59b5230d3e.webm?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/2b32a06618fca8fe23850d59b5230d3e.mp4?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/54e5ea5ef579844f5d3f8dab521015dd.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a unique mode of The Scouring, become a powerful hero, crushing foes with devastating skills. Gain experience, collect items, and customize your playstyle, blending action RPG combat with strategic army control. Shape battles with spells, weapons, and tactics to claim victory. Enter dungeons to look for precious items. BE THE HERO. Control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/dfccad7e03afacc99e687d6802ca94e9.poster.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/dfccad7e03afacc99e687d6802ca94e9.webm?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/dfccad7e03afacc99e687d6802ca94e9.mp4?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring delivers epic multiplayer battles with team skirmishes, and free-for-alls for up to 8 players. \u0421ustomize matches, and test your skill in dynamic modes. Forge alliances or dominate foes in the ultimate multiplayer RTS experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USER GENERATED CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring unlocks endless creativity with Steam Workshop integration. Download custom maps, modes, and AI scripts or create and share your own. With powerful tools and a vibrant community, every game offers fresh challenges and infinite variety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTION RPG STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring introduces a new genre: Action RPG Strategy. Customize your hero, equip gear, and unleash powerful abilities in fast-paced combat. While you dominate the battlefield, AI manages your army, resources, and bases, blending action and strategy seamlessly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/e199124842919bd45b3740cec1636582.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1d6b96b2f300938c6069633041788e78.poster.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1d6b96b2f300938c6069633041788e78.webm?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1d6b96b2f300938c6069633041788e78.mp4?t=1755286065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scouring started as a solo developer\u2019s dream to create the ultimate RTS. Inspired by classics and built with passion, it thrives on community feedback. Join our Discord, follow and read X, get in touch on Reddit! Together, we\u2019ll refine, expand, and create something special. Thank you for being part of this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338950/extras/1f925dce3b1b757d408fe6960bc5814f.avif?t=1755286065\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention to Detail</strong>: Immerse yourself in richly detailed, visually striking environments. Watch battles unfold with dynamic destruction, lifelike unit movement, and spell effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Gameplay</strong>: Fluid and polished controls that allow you to fully utilize your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action RPG Strategy</strong>: New gameplay experience and new genre. You control a powerful hero while AI manages your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>: Engage in ranked matches, free-for-alls, or team battles with custom games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User-Generated Content</strong>: Explore and share maps and modes via Steam Workshop. Create AI scripts to automate strategies and watch them play in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-Driven Development</strong>: Shaped by players and their feedback.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Scouring is an RTS with fast pace, high attention to detail and next generation experience. Lead humans or orcs in a Classic Mode or use one of powerful Heroes to fight for victory! Play alone or with friends. Use our modding tools to create maps and custom game modes! Join The Scouring!",
